     "title": "Who is responsible for your data",
     "body": "The controller for the processing described here is Ive Snijders, {address}, the Netherlands, KvK {kvk}.\n\nFor anything about your personal data, write to {email}. As a one-person business we are not required to appoint a Data Protection Officer; I handle privacy questions personally.",
